            <description><![CDATA[<!-- Shown in Mixwell's update window. Plain HTML, no <html>/<body> tags.
     For a new version: copy this file to <version>.html and replace the list. -->
<h2>Mixwell 1.0</h2>
<p>The first release. Every app gets its own volume in your menu bar.</p>
<ul>
  <li>A volume slider for each app that's playing sound, from silent up to 150% (200% in Settings).</li>
  <li>Mute any app with one click.</li>
  <li>Send an app to a different speaker or headphones.</li>
  <li>Mixwell remembers each app's level and output.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
